      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yYd5BvQ4kJDVGtnd\"><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em><strong>+4 to hit,</strong>, <strong>5 ft.,</strong> one creature. Hit:<strong> 1 </strong><em><strong>piercing damage</strong></em><strong>.</strong></p><p>The target must succeed on a <strong>DC 10 Constitution</strong> saving throw or be &amp;Reference[poisoned]{poisoned} for 1 minute. If the saving throw fails by 5 or more, the target is instead poisoned for 5 (1d10) minutes and &amp;Reference[unconscious]{unconscious} while poisoned in this way.</p></section><p>The Homunculus attacks with its Bite. The target must make a <strong>Constitution</strong> saving throw.</p>",
